                                                "sense_id": "3b175be1-6572-3499-a708-a5d92cc60dd2",
                                                "text": "Her rendition of \"Dry Land\" from her first album, Back to the Night, was a poetic fusion of music and lyrics that achieved an intimate tone too often sacrificed to confessionalism by other singers."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
